  <entry>
    <title>Fluid主题</title>
    <link href="/2025/06/05/hexo/Fluid%E4%B8%BB%E9%A2%98/"/>
    <url>/2025/06/05/hexo/Fluid%E4%B8%BB%E9%A2%98/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>记录一下自己使用 Fluid 主题的过程记录，这个是 hexo 博客的主题，所以在此之前，需要了解一下 <a href="/2025/06/05/hexo/hexo%20%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA/" title="hexo 博客搭建">hexo 博客搭建</a>。</p><h3 id="安装-Fluid-主题"><a href="#安装-Fluid-主题" class="headerlink" title="安装 Fluid 主题"></a>安装 Fluid 主题</h3><p>方式一：</p><p>获取最新版本</p><p>Hexo 5.0.0 版本以上，推荐通过 npm 直接安装，进入博客目录执行命令：</p><figure class="highlight ada"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs ada">npm install <span class="hljs-comment">--save hexo-theme-fluid</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>然后在博客目录下创建 <code>_config.fluid.yml</code>，将主题的. _config.yml. 内容复制过去</p><p>方式二：</p><p>下载解压：  <a href="https://github.com/fluid-dev/hexo-theme-fluid/releases">https://github.com/fluid-dev/hexo-theme-fluid/releases</a></p><h3 id="部署流程（本地）"><a href="#部署流程（本地）" class="headerlink" title="部署流程（本地）"></a>部署流程（本地）</h3><p>回顾上面的内容，在打开自己 的 obsidian 内容，然后复制到新的文件夹</p><p>执行下面命令（看实际下面两个命令就可以的）</p><figure class="highlight pgsql"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs pgsql"><br>npm install <span class="hljs-comment">--save hexo-theme-fluid</span><br><br>npx hexo <span class="hljs-keyword">server</span><br><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>到 Github Statis Page 的工作流在另外的篇章有过叙述。</p><h3 id="替换文本中的双链写法（obsidian样式）"><a href="#替换文本中的双链写法（obsidian样式）" class="headerlink" title="替换文本中的双链写法（obsidian样式）"></a>替换文本中的双链写法（obsidian样式）</h3><p>在 Hexo 目录的 <code>scripts/</code> 文件夹下新建文件 <code>obsidian-double-link.js</code>（若没有 <code>scripts</code> 文件夹请先创建）</p><p>obsidian-double-link.js</p><figure class="highlight arcade"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br><span class="line">43</span><br><span class="line">44</span><br><span class="line">45</span><br><span class="line">46</span><br><span class="line">47</span><br><span class="line">48</span><br><span class="line">49</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs arcade"><span class="hljs-comment">// scripts/obsidian-double-link.js</span><br>const &#123; basename &#125; = require(<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;path&#x27;</span>);<br><br>hexo.extend.<span class="hljs-built_in">filter</span>.register(<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;before_post_render&#x27;</span>, <span class="hljs-keyword">function</span>(<span class="hljs-params">data</span>) &#123;<br>  <span class="hljs-comment">// 匹配 文件名 或 文件名#锚点</span><br>  const regex = <span class="hljs-regexp">/\[\[([^[\]#]+?)(#([^[\]]+?))?\]\]/g</span>;<br>  <br>  <span class="hljs-comment">// 获取所有文章建立映射表（提高性能）</span><br>  const postsMap = &#123;&#125;;<br>  hexo.locals.get(<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;posts&#x27;</span>).forEach(<span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-params">post</span> =&gt;</span> &#123;<br>    const postName = basename(post.source, <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;.md&#x27;</span>);<br>    <span class="hljs-comment">// 创建两个映射：带空格的原名 和 规范化后的名称</span><br>    postsMap[postName] = post;<br>    <br>    <span class="hljs-comment">// 添加规范化名称的映射（去除特殊字符）</span><br>    const normalized = postName.<span class="hljs-built_in">replace</span>(<span class="hljs-regexp">/[^\w\u4e00-\u9fa5-]/g</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&#x27; &#x27;</span>).<span class="hljs-built_in">trim</span>();<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (normalized !== postName) &#123;<br>      postsMap[normalized] = post;<br>    &#125;<br>  &#125;);<br><br>  data.content = data.content.<span class="hljs-built_in">replace</span>(regex, (match, filePart, _, anchorPart) =&gt; &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-comment">// 提取文件名（不含路径和扩展名）</span><br>    const fileName = basename(filePart).<span class="hljs-built_in">replace</span>(<span class="hljs-regexp">/\.[^/.]+$/</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;&#x27;</span>);<br>    <br>    <span class="hljs-comment">// 规范化文件名（替换特殊字符为空格）</span><br>    const normalizedFileName = fileName.<span class="hljs-built_in">replace</span>(<span class="hljs-regexp">/[^\w\u4e00-\u9fa5-]/g</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&#x27; &#x27;</span>).<span class="hljs-built_in">trim</span>();<br>    <br>    <span class="hljs-comment">// 尝试查找匹配的文章（先尝试原名，再尝试规范化名称）</span><br>    let post = postsMap[fileName] || postsMap[normalizedFileName];<br>    <br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (post) &#123;<br>      <span class="hljs-comment">// 使用 post_link 标签格式</span><br>      <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (anchorPart) &#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-comment">// 处理锚点情况</span><br>        const anchor = anchorPart.<span class="hljs-built_in">trim</span>().toLowerCase().<span class="hljs-built_in">replace</span>(<span class="hljs-regexp">/\s+/g</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;-&#x27;</span>);<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-string">`&#123;% post_link <span class="hljs-subst">$&#123;post.slug&#125;</span> <span class="hljs-subst">$&#123;anchorPart.<span class="hljs-built_in">trim</span>()&#125;</span> %&#125;#<span class="hljs-subst">$&#123;anchor&#125;</span>`</span>;<br>      &#125; <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span> &#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-comment">// 无锚点情况</span><br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-string">`&#123;% post_link <span class="hljs-subst">$&#123;post.slug&#125;</span> %&#125;`</span>;<br>      &#125;<br>    &#125;<br>    <br>    <span class="hljs-comment">// 未找到文章时保留原始文本（去除特殊字符）</span><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> normalizedFileName + (anchorPart ? <span class="hljs-string">`#<span class="hljs-subst">$&#123;anchorPart&#125;</span>`</span> : <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;&#x27;</span>);<br>  &#125;);<br>  <br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> data;<br>&#125;);<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>重新生成博客</p><figure class="highlight verilog"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs verilog">hexo clean &amp;&amp; hexo <span class="hljs-keyword">generate</span><br><br>#执行下面命令<br>npx hexo clean &amp;&amp; npx hexo <span class="hljs-keyword">generate</span><br>npx hexo server<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><p>参考</p><ul><li><a href="https://hexo.fluid-dev.com/docs/start/">https://hexo.fluid-dev.com/docs/start/</a></li><li><a href="https://hexo.fluid-dev.com/">https://hexo.fluid-dev.com/</a></li></ul>]]></content>
    
    
